 Vesper (city 12; reek's W2 survey in the UOAIX-217 row). Its window holds no mountain land, field or pasture, and its
 lumberjack waits for a forest route outside the city (UOAIX-234), so it founds a fisherman and a herb farmer; the inn door
 is The Ironwood Inn's (UOX3 door 2771,975); the stations are the counters of The Ironworks, The Spinning Wheel and The Hammer and Nail.
