 Ocllo (city 6), by the same survey: thirteen single-room houses; five wild plant clusters; no furrowed land, mountain,
 fishmonger or carpenter in its window (its farms lie east of it), so it founds only a herb farmer. The inn door is The
 Bountiful Harvest's (UOX3 doors 3667,2623 and 3668,2623); the stations are the counters of Hammer & Steel Smithy, Now
 You're Cookin' and A Stitch In Time.
