 Cove (city 14; reek's W2 survey). Four houses, the first its lodging (Cove has no inn); ore on the mountain at its west
 edge, the furrowed field inside the town, the shore row by the docks; its one station counter is The Warrior's Supplies'
 smithy; no pasture, herbalist or woods (UOAIX-234).
