 Magincia (city 7) as it stood in 1998 (UOX3 felucca_magincia_original.jsdata): of its Britain roles only the fishmonger
 has a trade with ground in the window (no herbalist, carpenter, smith, provisioner, field or pasture), so it founds a
 fisherman. That template keeps 3 doors and the 1.25 statics show no roofed room outside the shops, so the fisherman
 lodges in the Fishermen's Guild hall, through its door 3695,2250; its evenings are at the Great Horns Tavern.
