 Moonglow (city 2; val's W2 survey and house floors in the UOAIX-217 row). Its 59 mountain cells are unplaced and it has
 no field, pasture or fishmonger, and its lumberjack waits for a forest outside the city (UOAIX-234), so it founds a herb
 farmer; the inn is The Scholar's Inn (door 4402,1159); the stations are the counters of The Mighty Axe, Scholar's Cut and
 Moonglow Carpenter.
