 Yew (city 3; val's W2 survey, house floors bounded by reek from the 1.25 statics, less The Jolly Baker's). It has no fishmonger
 or smith and its 604 mountain cells are unplaced; its lumberjack waits for UOAIX-234. Lodging Empath Abbey (door 607,819);
 the field is UOX3's wheat field, the pasture its sheep pen; the stations are The Sturdy Bow, The Tanned Hide and Bloody Thumb Woodworks.
