 Wind (city 4; val's W2 survey). The underground city holds no door in UOX3's felucca_doors, so its workers keep the
 Wind Inn's beds (no houses) and its door spot is the inn's floor. Its gardens are the wild-plant blocks the inn's floor walks
 to on the 1.25 statics (climb 2, 16 headroom); the larger grove at x 5232..5271, y 32..47 is a region of 3982 tiles joined to
 neither the inn nor Magical Supplies, so its herb farmer planned no route there (trial 43281). No mountain, field, pasture
 or shore, and Windy Clothes' counter is its only station.
