 Buccaneer's Den (city 11; reek's W2 survey in the UOAIX-217 row). Six houses (the Pirate's Den, the Plunder, the inn and the
 provisioner's halls are not), lodging The Peg Leg Inn (door 2717,2090); ore on the mountain spur 2736..2743,2184..2191; no
 fishmonger, herbalist, field, pasture or woods (UOAIX-234), so it founds miners; stations Cutlass Smithing and Violente Woodworks.
