 Trinsic (city 1), by the door-and-roof survey of the 1.25 statics: ten houses with roofed rooms of 14 tiles or more
 behind unsigned UOX3 doors (the 4-tile cells at x 1818..1826 left out); its trees stand south of the walls and its wild
 plants in five clusters; no furrowed land, mountain strip or fishmonger, so it founds a lumberjack and a herb farmer. Its
 innkeeper keeps The Rusty Anchor (sign 2030,2813), entered by UOX3 door 2018,2810; the stations are the counters of
 Trinsic's blacksmith, baker, tailor and carpenter.
