 mountain or fishmonger, so it founds a herb farmer, on its five richest wild plant clusters. Its innkeeper keeps The
 Morning Star Inn (sign 1376,3814), entered by UOX3 door 1375,3817; the stations are the counters of Jhelom's blacksmith,
 baker, tailor and carpenter.
